When selecting emergency power supplies, load calculation must be performed. We need to collect load information from various disciplines while also providing relevant requirements to other disciplines. This part is relatively basic and will not be elaborated further. If there are any questions, they can be raised later.  

When communicating with clients, it is necessary to clarify load-related requirements. Regarding the ATS grid-connection issue, confirmation is required on whether to adopt closed transition or synchronization mode. Manufacturers are critical resources during the design process.
